  2396	def cmd_check(args):
  2397	    """The one-command boundary: derive the floor, run the tests, run the
  2398	    reviewers the tier requires, record it all bound to HEAD, then gate.
  2399	
  2400	    Prints ONE line on success ("SAFE TO MERGE") and ONE concrete reason on
  2401	    failure ("STOP: ..."). Everything underneath is the existing primitives —
  2402	    classify, attest, gate — unchanged and still available for debugging; this
  2403	    only removes the eight-step ceremony the builder used to orchestrate by hand.
  2404	
  2405	    Fail-closed at every step: the first thing that cannot be verified stops the
  2406	    run and is named. WHO reviews and WHAT COMMAND runs them comes from the
  2407	    operator's trusted policy OUTSIDE the repository (see reviewer_policy) — a
