   869	    `reports/` ancestor can't relocate the write off-tree), and the final
   870	    component must not be a symlink (portable, holds where O_NOFOLLOW is absent).
   871	
   872	    Where the platform supports it (POSIX), the actual write additionally goes
   873	    through a PINNED directory fd (open the reports dir O_DIRECTORY|O_NOFOLLOW,
   874	    fstat-verify it IS the real reports dir, then openat the basename relative to
